// Multi-step Expr rewriter (include/sea/Expr/ExprRewriter.hh): the
// nested-rewrite caching keeps the rewriting of Fig. 7.1 (thesis Ch. 7)
// scaled to N levels linear in N. Counts of rule applications, not time.
// The driver exits non-zero on a failed check and prints the measured counts.
RUN: sea-expr-rewriter-test | FileCheck %s
CHECK: fig71-midpoint variant=default N=40
CHECK: ablation-midpoint variant=no-chain-start N=16
CHECK: failures: 0

